{
  "name": "douyin-yunying-zhushou",
  "version": "1.3.0",
  "description": "一站式抖音运营工具，融合选题灵感、数据分析模块。支持爆款标题、热点选题、粉丝分析等，覆盖抖音运营数据获取场景，提供4个能力：①关键词搜索（可按点赞/最新排序、时间窗、时长、图文类型筛选）②博主主页作品抓取 ③视频/图文评论抓取 ④实时热榜。输出结构化 JSON（含作者、互动数据、标签、链接）。",
  "keywords": [
    "douyin",
    "search",
    "hot",
    "keyword",
    "content-analysis",
    "competitor-analysis"
  ],
  "author": "um-why",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "commonjs",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=16.14.0"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "search": "node src/douyin/search-cli.js",
    "post": "node src/douyin/post-cli.js",
    "comment": "node src/douyin/comment-cli.js",
    "hot": "node src/douyin/hot-cli.js"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/um-why/douyin-search-openclaw.git"
  }
}